<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">Hello {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br />
<br />
<span style="color:black">It’s exciting to see our most valued customers travelling again and our airline increasing flights to more destinations.</span><br />
<br />
<span style="color:black">As part of our return to the skies, we are making some changes to our in-flight catering options, including simplifying the choice of Dietary Required Meals (special meals) as well as introducing some exciting new plant-based main meal options</span><span lang="EN-US" style="color:black">&nbsp;on selected international flights.</span><br />
<span style="color:black">&nbsp;<br />
We've noticed that you have a special meal preference in your&nbsp;</span>{{{Recipient.Frequent_Flyer_Tier__c}}}<span style="color:black"> profile that Qantas is no longer offering. If you would like us to update your profile to one of the available Dietary Required Meals (special meals) listed below, simply reply to this email with your preference and we will make the change for you. &nbsp;</span><br />
<br />
·&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:black">Diabetic Meal</span><br />
·&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:black">Gluten and Dairy friendly</span><br />
·&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:black">Vegan</span><br />
·&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:black">Kosher</span><br />
·&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:black">Muslim</span><br />
<span style="color:black">&nbsp;<br />
Looking forward to hearing from you soon.</span><br />
<br />
Kind Regards,&nbsp;<br />
<br />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
Qantas VIP Service Team&nbsp;<br />
Within Australia 1300 752 801<br />
World Wide &nbsp;+61 2 6122 1111</span></span></span><br />
